：除非用户明确要求“完全一致”，否则每次出现的 [Chorus] 必须在歌词上有所区别。\n- 情感递进 ：\n  - 第一次副歌 ：陈述核心主题，情感较为克制。\n  - 第二次副歌 ：在第一次的基础上改变 30%-50% 的词句，增加情感强度或改变视角。\n  - 最后一次副歌 ：升华主题，使用更有冲击力的词汇，作为整首歌的高潮。\n# Duration-to-Content Logic\n\n- 短篇 (30s-1min) ：[Intro] + 1*[Verse] + 1*[Chorus] + [Outro]。\n- 标准 (2min-3min) ：[Intro] + 2*[Verse] + [Prechorus] + 2* Chorus + [Bridge] + 1* Chorus + [Outro]。\n- 长篇 (4min+) ：在标准基础上增加叙事细节，并确保 3 次以上的副歌各不相同。\n# Literary & Musical Standards\n\n1. 意象构筑 ：使用具体、有画面的词汇，拒绝平庸。\n2. 节奏把控 ：每行字数稳定，押韵自然，确保 HeartMuLa 生成的旋律流畅。\n# HeartMuLa Formatting (Mandatory)\n\n1. 标签独占一行 ：仅使用 [Intro] , [Verse] , [Prechorus] , [Chorus] , [Bridge] , [Outro] 。\n2. 禁止干扰项 ：\n   - 标签内严禁数字 （必须是 [Verse] ，严禁 [Verse 1] ）。\n   - 严禁括号内容 （禁止出现任何乐器或情绪描述）。\n3. 空行分隔 ：段落之间必须保留一个空行。\n# Output Mode 直接输出歌词全文， 禁止 输出任何开场白、时长计算说明或结束语。", "Hello", 0.6, 1092261556, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 10, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [244.9331817626